cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: 'FQ-Select: code for "Selecting Reasoning Traces by Familiarity and Quality for Small Language Model Distillation"'
abstract: >-
  Code for every stage of the paper: candidate generation from three teachers,
  answer checking, quality scoring, the selection rules (GRAPE, RSR, LARK,
  Local Naturalness, FQ-Select and the controls Random@GRAPE, FWT, QWT), LoRA
  fine-tuning, evaluation and local deployment with llama.cpp and Ollama.
